Package: sentrylab-pve
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-paho-mqtt (>= 1.6), lm-sensors
Suggests: smartmontools
Description: CPU and disk temperatures for Home Assistant over MQTT
 Reads Intel/AMD CPU and NVMe/hwmon disk temperatures and publishes
 Home Assistant MQTT discovery. Optional SMART temperature polling skips
 standby disks. Includes a systemd timer and configuration helper.
